{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Neon Babylon\u2014a city where the dice never stop rolling, the champagne never stops flowing, and every win comes with a price. <br>Once the heir to a gambling empire, you now crawl back from the gutters with nothing but a stolen dealer\u2019s chip and a hunger for revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942290/extras/589951df9d95ded2fafd729043efa0db.avif?t=1759832068\" width=1536 height=864 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear Up:</strong> Seamlessly switch between <strong>rifles, sniper rifles, pistols,</strong> and a variety of other weapons during combat to handle any situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942290/extras/50c757aca42b42ae11d006fed13dce87.avif?t=1759832068\" data-has-big width=1560 height=975 /></span>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take the Wheel:</strong> Cruise the city streets in a wide range of <strong>cars</strong>. You can turn on the radio <strong>to play your favorite music,</strong> making every journey more enjoyable.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942290/extras/07026466c1c904b3faceab4e3bf1b301.avif?t=1759832068\" data-has-big width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boundless Exploration:</strong> Freely explore the vast city. Scale low walls and dive deep to <strong>swim in the ocean.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_i